/* ===================================================================
   Office Flip Out - Clipboard styles (legacy aggregator)

   This file intentionally contains no rules. It exists only so its
   imported GUID stays valid for any legacy UXML/UIDocument references.
   The clipboard's styles now live in:
     - clipboard.base.uss
     - clipboard.components.uss
     - clipboard.states.uss
   plus the design tokens at Assets/Resources/UI/Theme/Tokens.uss.
   New UXML documents should reference those files directly.
   =================================================================== */
